without truncated subtraction, so the assertion is meaningful in every size. -/
theorem odd_right_variable_mem_initial [CharZero K]
    (I : PluckerIndex (t+2) (2*k+1))
    (hbad : ∃ i,2*k+2+2*i.val<(I.val i).val+2*(t+2)) :
